      en: ["Chone was elevated to the status of a canton on August 7, 1822.", "The city is often referred to as the 'Garden City' of Manabí.", "The Chone River flows into the Pacific Ocean near Bahía de Caráquez.", "Chone is a major national producer of high-quality beef.", "The region is home to the cultivation of the famous 'Cacao Arriba.'", "The city suffered significant structural damage during the 2016 earthquake."],
