      en: ["Nueva Loja was officially established on January 25, 1979.", "The nickname 'Lago Agrio' originates from an oil field in Texas.", "The city is located approximately 20 kilometers from the Colombian border.", "The SOTE, Ecuador's main oil pipeline, begins its journey here.", "Nueva Loja is the most populous city in the Ecuadorian Amazon region.", "The Cuyabeno Wildlife Reserve is reachable from here within a few hours."],
