      en: ["Officially established as a canton on November 10, 1952.", "Sits at a low elevation of just 25 meters above sea level.", "The Zapotal River is navigable during the rainy season.", "Considered the agricultural heart of the Los Ríos Province.", "The city experiences an average temperature of 26 degrees Celsius.", "Famous for hosting the annual Maize Festival in November."],
