      en: ["The municipality was officially founded in 1887.", "El Triunfo is located in the Choluteca Department on the Nicaraguan border.", "The Guasaule border crossing is a key feature of this administrative area.", "The economy is driven by livestock ranching and basic grain farming.", "It experiences a dry tropical climate typical of the Pacific lowlands.", "The Pan-American Highway connects the town with major regional markets."],
