      en: ["Calceta became the seat of Bolívar Canton on October 13, 1913.", "The city is located in Manabí Province along the Carrizal River.", "It is famously nicknamed 'The City of the Three Bridges'.", "The central clock tower is a key historical and architectural landmark.", "The La Esperanza dam nearby is crucial for regional irrigation.", "It is home to the ESPAM university, focusing on agricultural sciences."],
