      en: ["Puerto Ayora is the largest urban center in the Galápagos Islands.", "The town is located on Academy Bay on the island of Santa Cruz.", "The Charles Darwin Research Station was established here in 1959.", "It was named after Isidro Ayora, a former president of Ecuador.", "Tortuga Bay is a world-class beach located just a short walk away.", "The town is the headquarters for the Galápagos National Park service."],
